flowchart LR
  E[outer every: every case has some answer] <-->|each the other's negation| S[outer some: some case has no answer]
  F[one found case] -. discharges nothing .- E
  X[one failed budgeted search] -. refutes nothing .- E
  P[an exhaustive search of a smaller set] -. refutes nothing .- E
  C["at one admitted case, a completed exhaustive search of the whole set 'some' ranges over, under EVD.42's guard, finding none"] -->|refutes| E
  Pr[a proof or a complete certificate] -->|only these refute| S
